PROVENANCE NOTES:
- `RQ4/ess_human_aggregates.json` contains subgroup-level aggregate
  statistics (no individual-level records) derived from European Social
  Survey (ESS) data. Please cite the ESS
  (https://www.europeansocialsurvey.org/) when reusing these statistics.
- `surveys/PVQ.json`, `PVQ21.json`, `BFI44.json`, and `BFI10.json` reproduce
  established psychometric instruments (Schwartz's PVQ; the BFI-44 of John &
  Srivastava; the BFI-10 of Rammstedt & John). Copyright in the instrument
  items remains with their respective authors; they are included solely for
  research reproducibility, and the CC BY 4.0 grant covers our encoding and
  annotations, not the underlying instrument text.
